---
import Layout from "../astro/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About — dejpeg">
  <article style="padding:var(--space-4);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      dejpeg is a browser-based JPEG artifact remover. It runs the
      <a href="https://github.com/jiaxi-jiang/FBCNN" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FBCNN</a>
      model entirely in your browser via WebGPU or WebAssembly, depending on
      what your device supports. Your images never leave your computer.
    </p>
    <p>
      The model is split into tiles, processed one at a time, and reassembled
      with feathered blending so any image size works without running out of
      memory.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
